             ++shader.scope;
+            // Cheaper variant, same idea as the "Fast" accurate multiplication mode of Citra MMJ:
+            // the PICA200 defines 0 * infinity = 0, while GLSL gives NaN. Any NaN product is
+            // replaced with 0 using a single isnan() and a single select. Tradeoff: a NaN that was
